{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium mobile-first carousel section that visually matches the attached reference as closely as possible.
    
    Do not redesign it.
    Do not simplify it.
    Do not create a different layout.
    
    Replicate the same structure, proportions, spacing and interaction style.
    
    ## Section Layout
    
    The section contains:
    
    1. Large headline at the top.
    2. Supporting paragraph underneath.
    3. Large horizontal card carousel.
    4. Circular arrow button on the right side.
    5. Pagination dots below the carousel.
    
    The visual hierarchy should match the reference image.
    
    ---
    
    ## Content Area
    
    ### Headline
    
    Large editorial headline.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Very large font size.
    * Multiple lines.
    * Tight line height.
    * Maximum width similar to the reference.
    * Left aligned.
    * Responsive typography.
    
    ### Supporting Text
    
    Place below the headline.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Smaller font size.
    * Maximum width similar to the reference.
    * Comfortable line height.
    * Left aligned.
    
    ---
    
    ## Carousel
    
    Create exactly 5 cards.
    
    No more.
    No less.
    
    Desktop:
    
    * Show multiple cards.
    * Center the carousel.
    
    Mobile:
    
    * Show one main card.
    * Reveal approximately 15–20% of the next card.
    * Smooth horizontal scrolling.
    
    ---
    
    ## Card Design
    
    Cards should match the reference layout.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Large rounded corners.
    * Premium modern look.
    * Overflow hidden.
    * Large image background.
    * Card content overlays the image.
    
    Structure:
    
    Top Left:
    
    * Card title.
    
    Bottom Left:
    
    * Optional metrics, labels or custom overlay content.
    
    Bottom Right:
    
    * Circular action button.
    
    ---
    
    ## Image Treatment
    
    The image is the main visual.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Full card background image.
    * Image fills entire card.
    * object-fit: cover.
    * No white space around image.
    * No thumbnail layout.
    * Image should extend edge-to-edge inside the card.
    
    Card ratio:
    
    ```css
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    ```
    
    ---
    
    ## Right Navigation Button
    
    Add a circular navigation button partially overlapping the right side of the active card.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * White circular background.
    * Black arrow icon.
    * Vertically centered.
    * Floating above cards.
    * Clicking moves to the next card.
    * Works on desktop and mobile.
    
    Position should visually match the reference.
    
    ---
    
    ## Bottom Action Button
    
    Each card includes a circular floating button in the lower-right corner.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * White circular background.
    * Black plus icon.
    * Positioned above image.
    * Floating appearance.
    
    ---
    
    ## Pagination Dots
    
    Below the carousel:
    
    * Exactly 5 dots.
    * One dot per card.
    * Active dot filled.
    * Inactive dots lighter.
    * Center aligned.
    
    ---
    
    ## Mobile Touch Behavior
    
    Extremely important:
    
    * Swipe left/right moves cards.
    * Swipe up/down scrolls page normally.
    * User can start touching directly on the card image.
    * No gesture locking.
    * No blocked vertical scrolling.
    
    Use:
    
    ```css
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    touch-action: pan-y pinch-zoom;
    ```
    
    ---
    
    ## Shopify Theme Settings
    
    Section:
    
    * Heading
    * Description
    * Background color
    * Padding top
    * Padding bottom
    
    Cards:
    
    * Title
    * Desktop image
    * Mobile image
    * Button icon
    * Link
    
    Use desktop image on desktop and mobile image on mobile, with fallback to desktop image.
    
    ---
    
    ## Design Goal
    
    The final result should visually match the attached reference almost one-to-one:
    
    * Same hierarchy.
    * Same card proportions.
    * Same spacing.
    * Same rounded corners.
    * Same carousel behavior.
    * Same floating arrow button.
    * Same pagination placement.
    * Same premium Apple / WHOOP style aesthetic.
    
    Do not redesign the section. Replicate the reference layout as closely as possible.
