    , The desktop implementation is currently incorrect.
    
    Please keep the visual design exactly the same and only fix the desktop carousel behavior.
    
    ### Desktop Requirements
    
    There are exactly 5 cards.
    
    On desktop:
    
    * All 5 cards must be visible at the same time.
    * Do not hide the 5th card.
    * Do not crop the last card.
    * Do not require horizontal scrolling to see the 5th card.
    * The full set of 5 cards must fit inside the desktop container.
    * Cards should automatically resize to fit available width.
    * The carousel should be centered within the page.
    * Equal spacing between all cards.
    * No card should extend outside the container.
    
    Desktop should behave as a static card row, not as a swipe carousel.
    
    ### Desktop Navigation
    
    When all 5 cards are visible:
    
    * Hide pagination dots on desktop.
    * Hide the floating next-arrow button on desktop.
    * Disable desktop carousel scrolling.
    * Disable horizontal dragging on desktop.
    * Desktop users should simply see all 5 cards at once.
    
    ### Mobile Behavior
    
    Keep the current mobile experience:
    
    * Show one primary card.
    * Show part of the next card.
    * Keep swipe functionality.
    * Keep pagination dots.
    * Keep the floating arrow button.
    * Keep touch gestures.
    
    ### Responsive Breakpoint
    
    Desktop (≥ 990px):
    
    * Show all 5 cards.
    * No slider functionality.
    
    Tablet and Mobile (< 990px):
    
    * Use the carousel.
    * Use dots.
    * Use arrow navigation.
    * Use swipe gestures.
    
    The final result should be:
    
    Desktop = clean 5-card grid.
    
    Mobile = interactive carousel.
    , The section is looking good overall. Please keep the current design and layout exactly as it is and only make the following usability improvements.
    
    ### Navigation Arrow Button
    
    The floating navigation arrow on the right side is currently too large and sits too far outside the card.
    
    Please:
    
    * Reduce the arrow button size by approximately 15–20%.
    * Move it slightly inward so it overlaps the card more naturally.
    * Keep the circular shape.
    * Keep the current icon style.
    * Keep the current visual design.
    
    The button should feel elegant and unobtrusive.
    
    ---
    
    ### Mobile Swipe Experience (Critical)
    
    The carousel should feel effortless to use on real mobile devices.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Users must be able to swipe left and right naturally with one finger.
    * Horizontal swiping should feel smooth and responsive.
    * Swiping should not require excessive force or long drag distances.
    * The carousel should respond immediately to horizontal gestures.
    * Navigation arrow clicks/taps should also continue to work correctly.
    * Arrow navigation and finger swiping must work together without conflicts.
    
    ---
    
    ### Vertical Page Scrolling (Critical)
    
    Users must always be able to scroll the page vertically, even when touching the carousel.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * If the user starts touching directly on a card, image, title, or any carousel element, vertical scrolling must still work.
    * The carousel must never trap the finger.
    * The page must never feel stuck.
    * No gesture locking.
    * No blocked scrolling.
    * The user should be able to smoothly continue scrolling the page while their finger is over the slider.
    
    Use native scrolling behavior and do not hijack touch gestures.
    
    ---
    
    ### Technical Requirements
    
    Do not use:
    
    ```javascript
    preventDefault()
    stopPropagation()
    ```
    
    on touch gestures.
    
    Do not block pointer events.
    
    Use passive touch listeners:
    
    ```javascript
    { passive: true }
    ```
    
    Use native scrolling:
    
    ```css
    .carousel-track {
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      touch-action: pan-y pinch-zoom;
      overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    }
    ```
    
    ---
    
    ### Expected Final Behavior
    
    * Swipe left/right → carousel moves smoothly.
    * Tap arrow → carousel moves to next card.
    * Swipe up/down → page scrolls normally.
    * Touching the slider never blocks page scrolling.
    * No freezing.
    * No stuck gestures.
    * No interaction conflicts between swipe navigation and arrow navigation.
    
    Do not change the layout, card sizes, typography, images, spacing, colors, or overall design.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-whoop-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_bg_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.section_padding_left }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.section_padding_right }}px;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.section_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size_mobile }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.heading_font_size_mobile -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_margin_bottom }}px 0;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.heading_max_width }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_mobile }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.description_line_height }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.description_font_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.description_max_width }}px;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.carousel_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    touch-action: pan-y pinch-zoom;
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    padding: 4px;
    margin: -4px;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.mobile_card_width }}%;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    {% if block.settings.card_shadow %}
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-top-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 80%;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_font_size_mobile }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.card_title_font_size_mobile -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.card_title_line_height }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.card_title_margin_bottom }}px 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_desc_font_size_mobile }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.card_desc_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.card_desc_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.card_desc_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.plus_button_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.plus_button_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.plus_button_bg }};
    border: none;
    display: {% if block.settings.show_plus_button %}flex{% else %}none{% endif %};
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: {{ block.settings.plus_button_size | times: 0.4 }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.plus_button_size | times: 0.4 }}px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.plus_button_icon }};
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.nav_button_bg }};
    border: none;
    display: {% if block.settings.show_nav_button %}flex{% else %}none{% endif %};
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 10;
    {% if block.settings.nav_button_shadow %}
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    {% endif %}
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.nav_button_icon }};
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: {% if block.settings.show_pagination %}flex{% else %}none{% endif %};
    justify-content: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.dot_spacing }}px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_inactive_color }};
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-whoop-carousel__dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_active_color }};
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size | times: 3 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.dot_size | divided_by: 2 }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-whoop-carousel__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_font_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__card-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_desc_font_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.tablet_card_width }}%;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-whoop-carousel__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_font_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__card-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_desc_font_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      overflow-x: visible;
      scroll-snap-type: none;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1 1 0;
      min-width: 0;
      max-width: {{ block.settings.desktop_card_width }}px;
      scroll-snap-align: none;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-whoop-carousel__pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<whoop-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-whoop-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.description != blank %}
      <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-whoop-carousel__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-carousel-track>
        {% for i in (1..5) %}
          {% liquid
            assign card_title_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_title'
            assign card_desc_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            assign card_desktop_image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_desktop_image'
            assign card_mobile_image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_mobile_image'
            assign card_link_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_link'
            assign card_link_target_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_link_target'

            assign card_title = block.settings[card_title_key]
            assign card_desc = block.settings[card_desc_key]
            assign card_desktop_image = block.settings[card_desktop_image_key]
            assign card_mobile_image = block.settings[card_mobile_image_key]
            assign card_link = block.settings[card_link_key]
            assign card_link_target = block.settings[card_link_target_key]
          %}

          <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card-index="{{ i }}">
            {% if card_mobile_image != blank %}
              <picture>
                <source media="(max-width: 749px)" srcset="{{ card_mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}">
                <img
                  src="{{ card_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ card_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="800"
                  height="1000"
                >
              </picture>
            {% elsif card_desktop_image != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ card_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ card_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="800"
                height="1000"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-top-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if card_title != blank %}
                  <h3 class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_title }}</h3>
                {% endif %}
                {% if card_desc != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_desc }}</div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if card_link != blank %}
                  <a 
                    href="{{ card_link }}" 
                    class="ai-whoop-carousel__card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" 
                    aria-label="View details"
                    {% if card_link_target %}target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
                  >
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                      <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                    </svg>
                  </a>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <button class="ai-whoop-carousel__nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-nav-button aria-label="Next slide">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-whoop-carousel__pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-pagination>
      {% for i in (1..5) %}
        <button
          class="ai-whoop-carousel__dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if i == 1 %}active{% endif %}"
          data-dot="{{ i }}"
          aria-label="Go to slide {{ i }}"
        ></button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</whoop-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class WhoopCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.track = null;
        this.cards = [];
        this.dots = [];
        this.navButton = null;
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.isScrolling = false;
        this.isDesktop = false;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-carousel-track]');
        this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-card-index]'));
        this.dots = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-dot]'));
        this.navButton = this.querySelector('[data-nav-button]');

        if (!this.track || this.cards.length === 0) return;

        this.checkViewport();
        this.setupEventListeners();
        this.updateActiveDot();
      }

      checkViewport() {
        this.isDesktop = window.innerWidth >= 990;
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        this.track.addEventListener('scroll', this.handleScroll.bind(this), { passive: true });

        if (this.navButton) {
          this.navButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!this.isDesktop) {
              this.scrollToNext();
            }
          });
        }

        this.dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!this.isDesktop) {
              this.scrollToIndex(index);
            }
          });
        });

        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
          this.checkViewport();
        }, { passive: true });
      }

      handleScroll() {
        if (this.isScrolling || this.isDesktop) return;

        this.isScrolling = true;
        clearTimeout(this.scrollTimeout);

        this.scrollTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
          this.isScrolling = false;
          this.updateCurrentIndex();
        }, 100);
      }

      updateCurrentIndex() {
        if (this.isDesktop) return;

        const scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft;
        const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
        const gap = parseInt(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap) || 16;
        const newIndex = Math.round(scrollLeft / (cardWidth + gap));

        if (newIndex !== this.currentIndex) {
          this.currentIndex = Math.min(Math.max(0, newIndex), this.cards.length - 1);
          this.updateActiveDot();
        }
      }

      scrollToNext() {
        if (this.isDesktop) return;

        const nextIndex = (this.currentIndex + 1) % this.cards.length;
        this.scrollToIndex(nextIndex);
      }

      scrollToIndex(index) {
        if (this.isDesktop || index < 0 || index >= this.cards.length) return;

        const card = this.cards[index];
        const cardRect = card.getBoundingClientRect();
        const trackRect = this.track.getBoundingClientRect();
        const scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft + (cardRect.left - trackRect.left);

        this.track.scrollTo({
          left: scrollLeft,
          behavior: 'smooth'
        });

        this.currentIndex = index;
        this.updateActiveDot();
      }

      updateActiveDot() {
        if (this.isDesktop) return;

        this.dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          if (index === this.currentIndex) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('whoop-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', WhoopCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

